{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1f79657abb92bb92","name":"Neural Band","source":{"id":"source:reference-1f79657abb92bb92","title":"Neural Band","revision":19270,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:38:08Z","sha256":"b8ae2141cde58e8afb636a759906c4bebe5ed58d5ff5e796d6b13b484dc3c2ce","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19270","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Neural%20Band&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1f79657abb92bb92","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Developed in response to both Sith and Jedi using ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to manipulate soldiers and security personnel, the Neural Band reinforces various synapses throughout the brain and provides alternative conduits for electrical impulses within the mind, making the wearer's thoughts difficult to affect. Neural Bands grant their wearers a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", but lowers the wearer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," by 2 points. A Neural Band cannot be worn at the same time as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," with a helmet or any other device worn on the head.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
